%% PathAdder —— 关键调用流程
%% 三条流程：A. 用户首次安装  B. 右键菜单动作  C. GitHub Actions 发布
%% 根化后全部流程语义不变。

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant Bat as install.bat<br/>(%~dp0)
    participant Inst as install.ps1
    participant i18n as lib\i18n.ps1
    participant SM as lib\ShellMenu.ps1
    participant Cm as lib\Common.ps1
    participant Reg as HKCU Registry
    participant Exp as explorer.exe

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over User,Exp: A. 首次安装（用户双击 install.bat）
    User->>Bat: 双击
    Bat->>Inst: powershell -NoProfile -STA -File "%~dp0install.ps1"
    Note right of Bat: %~dp0 指向 bat 所在目录<br/>根化后自然仍是应用根，无需修改
    Inst->>Inst: $script:ScriptRoot = $PSScriptRoot
    Inst->>i18n: . (Join-Path $ScriptRoot 'lib\i18n.ps1')
    i18n->>i18n: Get-PathAdderLanguageRoot()<br/>向上找 lang\ 目录
    i18n->>i18n: Import-PathAdderLanguagePack()<br/>先 en-US 后 zh-CN 覆盖
    i18n-->>Inst: $global:PathAdderStrings (552 keys)
    Inst->>Cm: . (Join-Path $ScriptRoot 'lib\Common.ps1')
    Inst->>SM: . (Join-Path $ScriptRoot 'lib\ShellMenu.ps1')
    Inst->>SM: Register-PathAdderMenu()
    SM->>Reg: 写 Software\Classes\*\shell\PathAdder<br/>+ SubCommands / command
    SM->>SM: SHChangeNotify(SHCNE_ASSOCCHANGED)
    SM-->>Inst: OK
    Inst->>User: 弹窗「安装完成」+ 询问是否重启 explorer<br/>(默认按钮 = 否)
    alt 用户选「是」 或 -RestartExplorer
        Inst->>Exp: Stop-Process explorer / Start-Process explorer.exe
        Note right of Exp: Windows 11 上 SHChangeNotify<br/>经常不足够，必须重启
    end
    User->>Exp: 右键任意 .exe → 「显示更多选项」→「PATH 助手」
    Exp->>Exp: 枚举注册表 verb
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 240)
    Note over User,Reg: B. 右键菜单动作（Add / Remove）
    Exp->>Exp: 用户点击「PATH 助手」→ MenuPicker.ps1 弹出 4 项
    Exp->>User: 用户选「Add to PATH (current user)」
    Exp->>Exp: powershell -File PathAdder.ps1 -Action Add -Scope User -Target "%V"
    Exp->>i18n: dot-source，加载语言
    Exp->>Cm: Add-PathAdderEntry()
    Cm->>Cm: Read-PathAdderPath() (保留 REG_EXPAND_SZ 类型)
    Cm->>Cm: Backup-PathAdderPath()<br/>→ %LOCALAPPDATA%\PathAdder\backups\user-YYYYMMDD-HHmmss.txt
    Cm->>Reg: 写 HKCU\Environment\Path
    Cm->>Cm: Write-PathAdderLog() → change.log
    Cm->>Cm: 广播 WM_SETTINGCHANGE
    Cm-->>User: 弹窗：成功 + 目录 + 备份文件名
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 235)
    Note over User,Exp: C. GitHub Actions 发布（push tag v*）
    actor Maint as 维护者
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant Rel as release.yml<br/>windows-latest / shell: powershell
    participant Build as com\build.ps1
    participant Temp as %TEMP%\PathAdderBuild
    participant Csc as Framework64\v4\csc.exe
    participant Zip as Compress-Archive
    participant Asset as Release Asset

    Maint->>GH: git push origin v1.0.0
    GH->>Rel: on: push tags v*
    Rel->>Rel: Resolve and verify version
    Rel->>Rel: 读 version.json → version
    alt tag 与 version.json 不一致
        Rel-->>Maint: ❌ FAIL（在编译 DLL 之前退出）
    end
    Note right of Rel: 只接受 ^v\d+\.\d+\.\d+(-pre)?$
    Rel->>Build: & .\com\build.ps1
    Build->>Build: $here=com, $scriptRoot=.<br/>dot-source lib\i18n.ps1
    Build->>Temp: 清空并新建 %TEMP%\PathAdderBuild
    Build->>Temp: Copy-Item *.cs（ASCII 路径，避 CS2001）
    Build->>Temp: 写 compile.rsp (UTF-8 BOM)
    Build->>Csc: csc.exe @compile.rsp（名字为拼接，绕过策略拦截）
    Csc-->>Temp: PathAdderShellExt.dll (x64)
    Note right of Build: CI 中目标 DLL 本不存在，<br/>「被锁」分支不会进入 → 不会调 release-dll.ps1
    Build->>Build: Copy-Item staged → com\PathAdderShellExt.dll
    Build-->>Rel: exit 0
    Rel->>Rel: Get-FileHash → dllSha256
    Rel->>Rel: 组装 stage\PathAdder-v1.0.0\
    Rel->>Rel: 白名单复制 + 剔除 diag-cascade.ps1 / *.old
    Rel->>Rel: 断言 com\PathAdderShellExt.dll 存在
    Rel->>Zip: Compress-Archive → PathAdder-v1.0.0-win-x64.zip
    Rel->>GH: softprops/action-gh-release<br/>tag_name + name + body_path + files
    GH->>Asset: 创建 Release + 上传 zip
    Asset-->>User: 用户下载并解压 → 双击 install.bat（回到流程 A）
    end

    rect rgb(250, 235, 245)
    Note over User,Exp: D. CI 校验（push / PR）
    participant CI as ci.yml<br/>shell: powershell (5.1)
    GH->>CI: on: push main / pull_request
    CI->>CI: 断言 PSVersion.Major == 5
    CI->>CI: Parser::ParseFile 每个 .ps1（断言 0 error）
    CI->>CI: BOM: .ps1/.cs 必须有，.bat 必须无
    CI->>CI: tools\Test-LanguagePacks.ps1（8 分片键集合相同）
    CI->>CI: tools\Test-TranslationKeys.ps1（T '...' 引用存在）
    CI->>CI: git ls-files 卫生检查 + 反误伤检查
    CI->>CI: i18n 冒烟（en-US / zh-CN 解析 App.Name）
    end
